<p>This my first SCP. It's cold and black and bitter, like delicious coffee. I don't think everyone will like it, but if it fails, it won't fail for lack of trying.</p>
<p>Thanks Zer0_Consistency for all the help with drafting! Edit &#8212; and Shaggydredlocks for all the help making this better after I posted it.</p>
<p>Edit - The new image is also from wikimedia commons: Image credit: Author unlisted; <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Smilie_Kissen.jpg#globalusage">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Smilie_Kissen.jpg#globalusage</a></p>
<p>Edit again - I see that I went overboard with the gimmicks and have cut them back &#8212; simplified the approach to redaction and scrapped the blue text. I feel like it's better now. This has been a good learning experience. Thanks everyone who read this, regardless of your reaction.</p>

