<p>While this skip might not have a narrative per se, the lack of one adds enough mystery as to what the narrative COULD be. What are the toys doing? Are they helpful or harmful? Were they always mechanical or was the developed after they came in contact with the child? So many questions, and left juuuust unanswered enough to make in mysterious and fascinating to read. Great job! +1</p>
<p>Also, wires going up a child's urethra&#8230; eugh&#8230; haunting</p>

