<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;hide</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>First, a quick one to put in the revisions to the procedures and other nitpicks you suggested, all of which I think will be improvements. I'll probably do that tonight.</p>
<p>Second, a more thorough one to expand the time travel narrative into more than an afterthought. There's validity to the criticism of shock over substance; for what it's worth, I started at an idea I wanted to realize and ended up at shock value, not the other way around, but at the end of the day this is a skip about dolls that cut up babies, and people's mileage is going to vary on that.</p>
<p>I'm not ashamed of using a thin plot if it accomplishes the gut-wrenching feeling I was going for, but having put in this much work, I'd like to nourish it up to its full potential. That's going to take some kind of perspective or idea I don't have right now, so I think I'm going to work on something else for a while and come back to this then. If I do come up with a direction for the big rewrite, can I message you to see what you think about it?</p>
<p>Either way, thanks again for taking the time to read this again and write up all these suggestions.</p>
</div>
